    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xea5e6b6b11905c",
      "translation": "Since northern horsemen threatened the river,\nthe ruined ponds, the towering trees\nstill loathe the talk of war.\nDusk gathers;\na clear horn blows a chill\nthrough the empty city.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xccc6f1bd205d55",
      "translation": "Since the northern horsemen probed the river and withdrew,\nruined pools and towering trees\nstill loathe the talk of war.\n\nDusk deepens. A chill horn sounds;\nits notes drift through the empty city.",
